{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107412","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107412","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710741201:0":{"text":"귀네스, 봐! 저 그림자... 널 닮았어!","source_cn":"格温妮丝，快看，这个影子……好像你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF8A43B7D652BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710741202:0":{"text":"닮은 게 아니야... 저건 나야.","source_cn":"……不，她就是我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227F0A96B9FC19DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710741203:1":{"text":"이 긴 꿈의 끝에서, 내가 싸워야 할 상대는 애초에 드래곤이 아니었던 거야...","source_cn":"原来，在这个漫长梦境的尽头，我要战胜的从来都不是什么巨龙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDE308A84C75C91E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710741204:1":{"text":"내가 진정으로 맞서야 할 상대는... 아버지의 실망을 두려워하며, 스스로를 “자격 없는 사람”이라 옭아매던 나 자신이었어...","source_cn":"而是那个总是害怕让父亲失望，总是觉得“不配”的我自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EFF8EB20CF2580B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710741205:0":{"text":"귀네스...","source_cn":"格温妮丝……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C643ACA6586F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710741206:1":{"text":"괜찮아, 에이르. 사실 난... 남들의 의심이나 비웃음 따윈 신경 쓰지 않는다고 생각했었어.","source_cn":"没关系，艾尔。我只是发现，那些旁人的质疑、嘲笑、否定…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C7878E15477FFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710741207:1":{"text":"하지만 사실은... 그 말들을 전부 마음에 담아둔 채, 내 안에서 이런 괴물을 키워왔던 거야...","source_cn":"但其实，是我自己把它们捡了起来，藏在心底，一点点喂养成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6D30210BEF0B15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710741208:1":{"text":"“자기 의심”이 높은 곳에서 날 내려다보며, 내 노력을 조롱하도록 내버려 둔 건... 결국 나 자신이었어.","source_cn":"是我允许这个“自我怀疑”站在高处，时刻俯视着我，嘲弄我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401D555144F7185A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710741209:1":{"text":"근데... 이제는 두렵지 않아.","source_cn":"但现在，我不怕了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA100E142BD734469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710741210:1":{"text":"물론, 난 완벽하지 않아. 어쩌면 또 실패할지도 모르지... 하지만 그런 건 중요하지 않아.","source_cn":"我不完美，我也许还会失败。但这都不重要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x964420A46090E7F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710741211:1":{"text":"나는 더 이상 누군가에게 내가 이 자리에 설 자격이 있다고 필사적으로 증명할 필요가 없어.","source_cn":"我不需要再拼命向谁去证明，我有资格站在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BBDF0E5C9F65D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710741212:1":{"text":"나는 귀네스! 내 손에 들린 활, 이것이 나의 대답이자 증명이야!","source_cn":"我是格温妮丝。手中的弓，就是我唯一的回答！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A7A50A6B6F41EA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:玩偶艾尔":{"text":"인형 에이르","source":"玩偶艾尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}